    "detailed_description": "The goal is simple - rid yourself of all your cards. Last player out is the Sh*thead.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Magic Cards<br />\r\nAs you climb the ranked league system, you'll unlock new ruleset variants with powerful magic cards that let you manipulate the flow of the game and disrupt your opponents' plans<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Competitive Progression:<br />\r\nBeat every league, earn achievements, and unlock new characters as you progress. Prove yourself as a champion by dominating the leaderboards and showcasing the fact that you, are in fact, not a Sh*thead.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udc65 Connect and Conquer:<br />\r\nCreate a private room with custom rules for you and your friends, or join the global community for ranked matches. Chat, strategize, and play with others from around the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith an unpredictable mix of luck and skill, Sh*thead is the classic backpacking card game loved around the globe.",
